Agreement for the uniform system of maritime buoyage, and rules annexed
                        thereto, Geneva, May 13, 1936; not in force; Docs. C.128.M.67.1936.VIII.6;
                        C.128 (a) .M.67 (a) .1936.VIII.7; and C.261.M.154.1936.VIII.11.

Convention relating to the transmission in transit of electric power, and
