Austria. Articles 62–69 of the treaty of
                        peace with Austria, signed at Saint-Germain-en-Laye, September 10, 1919;
                        resolution of Council, October 27, 1920 (League of Nations, Official Journal, 1920, No. 8, p. 10).

Bulgaria. Articles 49–57 of the treaty of
                        peace with Bulgaria, signed at Neuilly-sur-Seine, November 27, 1919;
                        resolution of Council, October 27, 1920 (League of Nations, Official Journal, 1920, No. 8, p. 11).

International opium convention, and protocol, Geneva, February 19, 1925;
